    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "040481d9-c298-4930-8bdb-526a8c31fbbd",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "BCR Vol. 91 - Staff Paradox",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102754072747",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ab6d4ee5-6252-4592-8ea6-76dd77ec708d).Image",
        "Description": "A staff can be many things.\r\rSometimes it is an invaluable walking aid for the desperate traveler.\rSometimes it is a weapon of war, ornate and bladed.\rSometimes the staff is meant to serve, to be obedient. To only talk when talken to.\rFollow the rule of law and physics or be punished.\r\rAnd if the staff snaps?\rIs it broken beyond disrepair or will it behave in unexpected erratic ways?\r\rThe only way to know is to BECOME the staff.\rWill reality collapse? Or will you shape a new future?\r\rBy Celllie",
